== Representation

BCD - Binary-Coded Decimal
- 4 bits per digit (10 values)
- 0-9

Integer - two's complement
- 4 bits represent 16 values
- More efficient than BCD, according to Shannon

== Analog Computer

- BCD represented by 10 voltage ranges
- Arithmetic operations performed on voltage